get.summary:
Own aggregated inventory: the total available quantity per article type (only what is &gt; 0).
Counterpart to the activation `POST` and the father view (`children/{childId}/shop/inventory`);
the same data is also available bundled in `GET me/shop`.

CreatePositionDto.description:
Creating a position. Empty override fields inherit the exercise's suggestion (hybrid principle):
stage/item count then stay `null` and are resolved from the exercise defaults only when played;
the points/bonus fields are prefilled from the exercise's bonus suggestion.
